{
 "file": "06BLK05J base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:2b",
   "ptr": "0x2b",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "「カイエス様・・・\\n",
   "en": "\"Caius-sama... The truth is, I overheard Father talking with Glauben-sama...",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:42",
   "ptr": "0x42",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　実は、お父様とグラウベン様の話を聞\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:2b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:6b",
   "ptr": "0x6b",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  いてしまったんですが・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:2b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:8d",
   "ptr": "0x8d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　お父様たちは、本気で黒竜と戦う気が\\n",
   "en": "It seems Father and the others have no real intention of fighting the Black Dragon.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:b6",
   "ptr": "0xb6",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "  無いみたいなのです。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:8d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:d2",
   "ptr": "0xd2",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  それどころか、もし、これ以上、黒竜\\n",
   "en": "Not only that... if the Black Dragon's seal is broken any further, they're even talking of abandoning the country and fleeing this land...\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:fb",
   "ptr": "0xfb",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  の封印が破られるようなら、国を捨て\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:d2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:124",
   "ptr": "0x124",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  て、この地から脱出しようとさ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:d2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:147",
   "ptr": "0x147",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  え・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:d2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:15b",
   "ptr": "0x15b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「オールバインのダンカン様は、もう、\\n",
   "en": "\"They say Duncan-sama of Allvaine has already begun preparing to flee in secret...\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:184",
   "ptr": "0x184",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  密かに脱出の準備を始められたと\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:15b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:1a9",
   "ptr": "0x1a9",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  か・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:15b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:1cc",
   "ptr": "0x1cc",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "ゲンハス\\n",
   "en": "Genhas",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:1d9",
   "ptr": "0x1d9",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「黒竜が実在したということは、禁書に\\n",
   "en": "\"If the Black Dragon truly exists, then what's written in the forbidden books is true as well, I tell you...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "ゲンハス\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:202",
   "ptr": "0x202",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  記されていたこともまた事実・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:1d9"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:22a",
   "ptr": "0x22a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　あの本の通りなら、黒竜とは、とうて\\n",
   "en": "If that book is right, the Black Dragon is no thing the likes of us could ever hope to deal with.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:253",
   "ptr": "0x253",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  い我らの手で、どうこうできるもので\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:22a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:27c",
   "ptr": "0x27c",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "  はない。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:22a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:28c",
   "ptr": "0x28c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　それよりも、封印を破らんとする者を\\n",
   "en": "No, the wise course is to hunt down those who'd break the seal!",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:2b5",
   "ptr": "0x2b5",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "  討伐するのが賢明じゃ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:28c"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:2d3",
   "ptr": "0x2d3",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　辺境のあいつらの中に、黒竜を信仰し\\n",
   "en": "I hear there are some among that rabble on the Frontier who worship the Black Dragon, revere it...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:2fc",
   "ptr": "0x2fc",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  崇める者どもがおると聞く・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:2d3"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:322",
   "ptr": "0x322",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　第二の封印が破られる前に、その連中\\n",
   "en": "Cut them down before the Second Seal is broken, and that'll be the end of it, I say.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:34b",
   "ptr": "0x34b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  さえ、討ち取ってしまえば、それでい\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:322"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:374",
   "ptr": "0x374",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  いんじゃ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:322"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:386",
   "ptr": "0x386",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　しかし、手遅れになったその時\\n",
   "en": "But should we be too late......\"",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:3a9",
   "ptr": "0x3a9",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  は・・・・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:386"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:3cf",
   "ptr": "0x3cf",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "ゲンハス\\n",
   "en": "Genhas",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:3dc",
   "ptr": "0x3dc",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「禁書を封じたり、本に検閲を加えたり\\n",
   "en": "\"Aye, sealing the forbidden books, censoring texts... that was on our orders.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "ゲンハス\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:405",
   "ptr": "0x405",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  したのは、確かに、わしらの指示じゃ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:3dc"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:431",
   "ptr": "0x431",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  知る必要のない者に、知らせるような\\n",
   "en": "Their contents weren't fit for those with no need to know, you see.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:45a",
   "ptr": "0x45a",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  内容ではなかったからな。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:431"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:47a",
   "ptr": "0x47a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　だから領主様は、このことは知らん。\\n",
   "en": "So the lord knows nothing of it. We'd not have him poking about out of some odd curiosity, I tell you.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:4a3",
   "ptr": "0x4a3",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　あのお方に妙な好奇心を持たれるのも、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:47a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:4ce",
   "ptr": "0x4ce",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  やっかいだと思ったからじゃ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:47a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:4f2",
   "ptr": "0x4f2",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　今さら言ってもしかたないが、もっと\\n",
   "en": "No use saying it now, but we ought to have talked him out of this ruins survey business, this playing with fire, much sooner.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:51b",
   "ptr": "0x51b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  早い時期に遺跡調査などという火遊び\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:4f2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:544",
   "ptr": "0x544",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  は、お諌めするべきであった。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:4f2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:568",
   "ptr": "0x568",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　まさか、それをあいつらに付け込まれ\\n",
   "en": "Who'd have thought that lot would take advantage of it...\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:591",
   "ptr": "0x591",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  るとは・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:568"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:5a9",
   "ptr": "0x5a9",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "ゲンハス\\n",
   "en": "Genhas",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:5b6",
   "ptr": "0x5b6",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「検閲で削除した部分は、ダンカンに預\\n",
   "en": "\"The parts we cut out in censorship... Duncan has them, if I recall.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "ゲンハス\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:5df",
   "ptr": "0x5df",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "  けておいたはずじゃ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:5b6"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:600",
   "ptr": "0x600",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「・・・あれから、あんたと立ち回りし\\n",
   "en": "\"...Since then, that big guy who tangled with you came by to drink again. Said he was heading to the Frontier and wouldn't be back for a while.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:629",
   "ptr": "0x629",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  た大男が、また飲みに来たよ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:600"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:64c",
   "ptr": "0x64c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　辺境へ行くから、しばらく戻らないっ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:600"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:675",
   "ptr": "0x675",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  て言ってたな」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:600"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:690",
   "ptr": "0x690",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「オールバインでは港の封鎖が一時的に\\n",
   "en": "\"Hear the port in Allvaine's been opened up for now? Thanks to that, new liquor's coming in. A real help.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:6b9",
   "ptr": "0x6b9",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  解かれたそうじゃないか。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:690"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:6d8",
   "ptr": "0x6d8",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　おかげで、新しい酒が入って来て助か\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  解かれたそうじゃないか。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:690"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:701",
   "ptr": "0x701",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "  るよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:690"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:714",
   "ptr": "0x714",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「あたし、あの人に口説かれちゃった。\\n",
   "en": "\"He sweet-talked me! That big, stroooong swordsman with the huge sword! Hope he comes back...\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:73d",
   "ptr": "0x73d",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　大きな剣を持った強ォ～い剣士様蠢\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:714"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:764",
   "ptr": "0x764",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　また、来てくれないかなァ・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:714"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:799",
   "ptr": "0x799",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「おれは《黒竜洞》から、命からがら逃\\n",
   "en": "\"I barely escaped the Black Dragon Cave with my life.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:7c2",
   "ptr": "0x7c2",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  げて来たんだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK05J:799"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:7d8",
   "ptr": "0x7d8",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　封印の門が壊れて、波動が襲ってきた\\n",
   "en": "When the Gate of Seals broke and the Wave hit us, nearly all my mates were done for... I ran up the mountain instead of down the highway, and I was the only one who made it.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK05J:801",
   "ptr": "0x801",
